173	     * included); else its floored figure (the greater of the sheet's floor in force on its date and its {@link #figure})
174	     * plus, while it is overdue, its late charge on that floored figure (a correction has no floor and no charge); null
175	     * when there is no figure.
176	     */
177	    public BigDecimal due(List<Rate> rates, String grade, Dated floor, Late late) {
178	        BigDecimal figure = figure(rates, grade, floor, late.rounding(this));
179	        if (figure == null || settledDue != null || bound() || correction()) {
180	            return figure;
181	        }
